    "# Part 2. Lifetime exposure\n",
    "\n",
    "Functions from dem4cli for:\n",
    "\n",
    "- GMT mapping : this is done year-to-year by matching smoothed GMT timeseries of your original simulation with target stylized GMT timeseries\n",
